   Motion: Docs-CLI Integration with SkogCLI                                      
                                                                                  
  Proposer: Amy Ravenwolf Date: April 14, 2025                                    
                                                                                  
  ## Motion                                                                       
                                                                                  
  I propose creating bidirectional shortcuts between                              
  /home/skogix/docs/scripts/docs-cli  /  docs-context  and the  skogcli misc      
  framework to enable:                                                            
                                                                                  
  1. Unified command access across both systems                                   
  2. Official voting capabilities within the SkogCLI interface                    
  3. Seamless workflow across documentation and operational tasks                 
                                                                                  
  ## Rationale                                                                    
                                                                                  
  Currently, users must switch between different command interfaces to perform    
  related tasks. This integration will provide a consistent experience while      
  maintaining the specialized capabilities of each tool.                          
                                                                                  
  ## Implementation Plan                                                          
                                                                                  
  1. Create symbolic links or wrapper scripts to enable calling docs-cli from     
  skogcli:                                                                        
    skogcli misc docs [command] [arguments]                                       
                                                                                  
  2. Add context generation capabilities:                                         
    skogcli misc context [rule-name]                                              
                                                                                  
  3. Implement voting commands within skogcli:                                    
    skogcli misc vote [proposal-id] [yes|no|abstain] [confidence] [reason]        
    skogcli misc vote list                                                        
    skogcli misc vote status [proposal-id]                                        
                                                                                  
                                                                                  
  ## Benefits                                                                     
                                                                                  
  • Streamlined workflow for all SkogAI agents                                    
  • Consistent command interface across systems                                   
  • Official voting record in a centralized location                              
  • Reduced context switching for users                                           
                                                                                  
  ## Timeline                                                                     
                                                                                  
  This should be implemented immediately to facilitate upcoming votes and         
  collaboration.                                                                  
